/T (Multiple bodies of academic literature have documented the existence of systematic differences between overnight and intraday returns on US equities and ETFs [7]; however, the extent to which such patterns persist across different market structures and geographical regions remains an active area of research. To examine whether similar return dynamics are present in the Indian market, this study analyzes the performance of the NIFTY 50 Index by segregating total returns into overnight and intraday components. The analysis seeks to determine whether overnight returns account for a disproportionate share of overall market performance and whether such returns can be practically captured through a futures-based trading strategy)
/E (Multiple bodies of academic literature have documented the existence of systematic differences between overnight and intraday returns on US equities and ETFs [7]; however, the extent to which such patterns persist across different market structures and geographical regions remains an active area of research. To examine whether similar return dynamics are present in the Indian market, this study analyzes the performance of the NIFTY 50 Index by segregating total returns into overnight and intraday components. The analysis seeks to determine whether overnight returns account for a disproportionate share of overall market performance and whether such returns can be practically captured through a futures-based trading strategy)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [14]
>>
