/T (Having established the existence of this anomaly in the indian equity market, the subsequent analysis examines whether this can be transformed into a profitable and practically implementable investment strategy. A systematic overnight trading strategy is constructed using NIFTY Index futures, providing liquid and efficient exposure to the underlying index. This section outlines the framework employed to implement and execute this strategy. Covering the trading rules, portfolio construction methodology, transaction cost assumptions, and performance evaluation metrics presented in detail. The performance of the proposed strategy is compared to a passive buy-and-hold benchmark using both absolute and risk-adjusted performance measures)
/E (Having established the existence of this anomaly in the indian equity market, the subsequent analysis examines whether this can be transformed into a profitable and practically implementable investment strategy. A systematic overnight trading strategy is constructed using NIFTY Index futures, providing liquid and efficient exposure to the underlying index. This section outlines the framework employed to implement and execute this strategy. Covering the trading rules, portfolio construction methodology, transaction cost assumptions, and performance evaluation metrics presented in detail. The performance of the proposed strategy is compared to a passive buy-and-hold benchmark using both absolute and risk-adjusted performance measures)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [5]
>>
