/Title (Using daily OHCLV NIFTY 50 data from 20 June 2020 to 21 June 2026, it was noticed that NIFTY 50 generated a cumulative return of 84.37% over the sample period, 156.33% of this return was attributable to overnight price movements, whereas intraday returns contributed -71.96%.)
