752 0 obj
<<
/Title (Despite the encouraging findings, the study is prone to several limitations. Firstly, the analysis is conducted over a limited sample period from June 2020 to June 2026, which may not capture the behaviour of the market across different economic and market cycles. The study further assumes a constant margin requirement of 15% and fixed cost parameters, which may vary depending on market conditions and regulatory changes. The study also assumes execution at the official opening and closing prices of the futures contracts. Actual implementation may be affected by execution delays and liquidity constraints. The analysis focuses exclusively on the NIFTY50 Index and its future contracts; the results may not necessarily generalise to other asset classes or international equity markets.)
/Dest [17 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 740 0 R
/Next 753 0 R
>>
endobj
